---
description: Bootstrap the Superpowers skills library for every conversation
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses the Superpowers skills library in `.cursor/skills/`.

At the start of every conversation, read `.cursor/skills/using-superpowers/SKILL.md` and follow it. To "invoke" a skill, read its `SKILL.md` from `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/` with the Read tool before acting.
